      "sequence_position": 2,
      "problem": "Consider the matrix $B=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}].$ Find ${B}^{2}.$\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\">${B}^{2}=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-3}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-4}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">$11$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-5}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
